This module uses only a loopback synthetic accessory. Controller and accessory
share hc cryptographic primitives; this is a protocol lifecycle qualification,
not independent cryptographic validation and not an ECB601 driver.
No secret is supplied by the environment, discovery, Home Assistant or a device.
